/* Main Screen */
"Today's Recommendation" = "今日建议";
"HRV Status" = "HRV 状态";
"Current HRV" = "当前 HRV";
"Baseline" = "基准值";
"Recovery Score" = "恢复评分";
"Trend" = "趋势";
"Refresh" = "刷新";
"Settings" = "设置";

/* Status */
"Rest recommended. Your body needs recovery." = "建议休息。你的身体需要恢复。";
"Moderate exercise is suitable." = "适合进行中等强度的锻炼。";
"Great condition! Good time for intense training." = "状态极佳！适合进行高强度训练。";

/* Advice */
"Your body needs rest today. Focus on recovery activities like light stretching or walking." = "今天你的身体需要休息。专注于恢复活动，如轻度拉伸或步行。";
"Your recovery is excellent! This is a great day for high-intensity training or a challenging workout." = "你的恢复状况极佳！今天非常适合进行高强度训练或挑战性锻炼。";
"Your recovery is good. You can proceed with moderate training as planned." = "你的恢复状况良好。可以按计划进行中等强度训练。";
"Your recovery is below baseline. Consider light exercise or rest." = "你的恢复状况低于基准。考虑进行轻度锻炼或休息。";
"Your HRV is trending upward, which is a positive sign." = "你的 HRV 呈上升趋势，这是一个积极的信号。";
"Your HRV is trending downward. Be mindful of overtraining." = "你的 HRV 呈下降趋势。注意避免过度训练。";
"Your HRV is stable." = "你的 HRV 保持稳定。";

/* Recovery Advice */
"Continue your current recovery practices. Your body is responding well." = "继续当前的恢复方法。你的身体反应良好。";
"Maintain good sleep hygiene and stay hydrated. Consider adding a recovery day if needed." = "保持良好的睡眠习惯并补充水分。必要时考虑增加恢复日。";
"Prioritize sleep (8+ hours), hydration, and nutrition. Avoid intense training until HRV improves." = "优先保证睡眠（8小时以上）、水分和营养。在 HRV 改善之前避免高强度训练。";

/* Workout Intensity */
"Very Light" = "非常轻松";
"Light" = "轻松";
"Moderate" = "中等";
"High" = "高强度";
"Recovery pace, can hold a conversation easily" = "恢复配速，可以轻松交谈";
"Easy pace, comfortable breathing" = "轻松配速，呼吸舒适";
"Steady pace, somewhat hard breathing" = "稳定配速，呼吸略急促";
"Fast pace, hard breathing" = "快速配速，呼吸困难";

