/* Multi-Dimensional Recovery */
"RHR" = "静息心率";
"Sleep" = "睡眠";
"Load" = "负荷";
"Your recovery is excellent! Perfect day for high-intensity training or challenging workouts." = "你的恢复状况极佳！非常适合高强度训练或挑战性锻炼。";
"Your recovery is good. You can proceed with moderate to high intensity training." = "你的恢复状况良好。可以进行中高强度训练。";
"Your recovery is fair. Consider moderate intensity or focus on technique work." = "你的恢复状况一般。考虑中等强度或专注技术训练。";
"Your recovery is poor. Light exercise or active recovery recommended." = "你的恢复状况较差。建议轻度锻炼或主动恢复。";
"Your recovery is very poor. Rest day recommended. Focus on sleep and nutrition." = "你的恢复状况很差。建议休息日。专注睡眠和营养。";
"Consider stress management techniques like meditation or deep breathing" = "考虑压力管理技巧，如冥想或深呼吸";
"Your resting heart rate is elevated. Ensure adequate hydration and rest" = "你的静息心率偏高。确保充足的水分和休息";
"Aim for 7-9 hours of sleep per night" = "目标每晚7-9小时睡眠";
"Improve sleep quality: avoid screens before bed, keep room cool and dark" = "改善睡眠质量：睡前避免屏幕，保持房间凉爽黑暗";

