/* Measurement Reminders */
"Time to Measure HRV" = "该测量HRV了";
"Good morning! Measure your HRV now for the most accurate reading." = "早上好！现在测量HRV可以获得最准确的读数。";
"Measurement Quality Tips" = "测量质量建议";
"Your measurement quality was fair. For best results, measure between 6-10 AM right after waking up." = "你的测量质量一般。为获得最佳结果，请在早上6-10点刚醒来时测量。";
"Your measurement quality was poor. Try measuring in the morning (6-10 AM) while sitting calmly." = "你的测量质量较差。尝试在早上（6-10点）安静坐着时测量。";
