"You've measured your HRV for %d consecutive days! Keep up the great work!" = "你已连续测量HRV %d天！继续保持！";
"Optimal Measurement Window" = "最佳测量窗口";
"You're in the optimal measurement window (6-10 AM). Measure now for the most accurate results!" = "你正处于最佳测量窗口（6-10点）。现在测量可获得最准确的结果！";

